Project DBML {
  Note: '''
    # Spare Cores Navigator database schemas

    The tables of the [Spare Cores Navigator](https://docs.sparecores.com/overview) database: the servers, managed databases, storage and other cloud resources of the supported vendors, with their prices and benchmark results. These components of the Navigator work with the database:

    * The [Crawler](https://github.com/SpareCores/sc-crawler) (`sparecores-crawler`) compiles it, e.g. to build your own copy.
    * The [Data Wrapper](https://github.com/SpareCores/sc-data) (`sparecores-data`) downloads an up-to-date copy.
    * The [Navigator API](https://github.com/SpareCores/sc-keeper) serves it over HTTP.
  '''
}
